a point has an x (a number) and a y (a number).
let points be a list of a new point with x 1 and y 2, a new point with x 3 and y 4.
say points.
let named be a map of "a" to a new point with x 1 and y 2, "b" to a new point with x 5 and y 6.
say named.
a shape is one of:
    a circle with a radius (a number).
    a dot.
let shapes be a list of a new circle with radius 1, a new dot and a new circle with radius 2.
say shapes.

to report with problem and message:
    say problem, message.
let word be "x".
report with "bad" and "I expected " followed by word.
report with "sum" and (2 plus 3 times 4) as text.
a dog has a name (text).
a dog can greet with other (text):
    say dog's name, "greets", other.
let rex be a new dog with name "Rex".
greet rex with "Ann" followed by "!".
